         - DataExtractionRules: allowBackup="false" — backup is disabled entirely, so
           fullBackupContent is meaningless.
         - DiscouragedApi x4 (getIdentifier by name): locale/layout resource lookup is
           part of the AOSP-fork design.
         - StaticFieldLeak (KeyboardSwitcher singleton): lives exactly as long as the
           IME process by design.
         - InflateParams: the IME input view is inflated parentless by design.

         Cosmetic / not actionable (leave):
         - RedundantLabel x3, Overdraw x2, UseRequiresApi, UsableSpace,
           TextFields, Autofill x2,
           LabelFor x2, ClickableViewAccessibility x2 (legacy views).
           (The UnusedResources x2 — icon_launcher_text glyph data and the
           AppText.Button style — were deleted with the resources themselves in
           the 2026-09-25 SAFE wave.)

         Live but conscious, reported outside the baseline:
         - VectorPath (ic_launcher_foreground.xml, O2): the traced brand icon's
           compound path is 3 217 chars; the icon renders once per launcher
           layout, so the redraw cost the detector warns about never recurs.

